name issue_62_neteq_v2_cross_traffic
describe cross_traffic with NetEq's Expand (neteq v2, issue #62): whole pitch periods, Expand's mute factor for PostponeDecode, Normal's unmute after an expand
duration 40s
neteq v2
at 0s  capacity=3000kbps delay=25ms queue=300ms
at 10s cross=1500kbps
at 25s cross=0kbps
# libwebrtc M157 on cross_traffic (compare-webrtc, seeds 1-10): longest audio
# interruption 100, 80, 70, 30, 50, 30, 20, 30, 30, 20 ms, no interruptions.
# neteq v2 with our PLC fade (#215), seeds 1-5: 10, 10, 20, 10, 20 ms; with
# NetEq's Expand: 70, 20, 70, 10, 90 ms.
expect audio.interruptions == 0
expect audio.longest_interruption_ms >= 40
expect audio.longest_interruption_ms <= 150
expect video.freeze_count == 0
expect cc.queue_p95_ms < 250
